Coding agents
The LLM needs to be able to read our working directory:

chat$register_tool(tool(
  function() dir(),
  name = "ls",
  description = "Lists the files in the current directory"
))



And be able to remove files:

chat$register_tool(tool(
  function(path) unlink(path),
  name = "rm",
  description = "Delete one or more files",
  arguments = list(
    path = type_array(type_string())
  )
))

Detour: Clean Up the DataTable

  dat_names_agg &lt;- reactive({ 
    dat_names() %&gt;%
      group_by(name) %&gt;%
      summarize(count = sum(n)) %&gt;%
      arrange(desc(count))
  })

  output$table &lt;-  renderDT({
     datatable(dat_names_agg(), 
              options = list(paging = FALSE,
                             searching = FALSE,
                             orderClasses = TRUE))

  })

